  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth Innovation Summit in Morocco 2019 under Danish-Arab Partnership Programme 2017-2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Youth Innovation Summit in Morocco 2019 has the following related (long-term) objectives:

&#x2022;	 Solutions: Generate new ideas and tangible solutions that tackle important sustainable development challenges, particularly in the area of employment and livelihoods, a key area of focus within the DAPP framework.
&#x2022;	Participants: Young talents will deepen their technical skills and expand their networks that can help bring their ideas to life, whereas a broader audience will learn about core program priorities and cutting-edge solutions.
&#x2022;	Job-creation: Create new job opportunities and support talents in implementing their solutions
&#x2022;	Partner dialogue: Foster increased public engagement and partner dialogue within DAPP and the broader sector to strengthen youth-inclusive partnerships.
&#x2022;	Awareness: Create widespread awareness among all stakeholders, including youth, of the DAPP agenda, the 2030 Agenda as a whole, and the strong Danish support in the region.
&#x2022;	Bilateral relations: Reaffirm a strong relationship between Denmark and Morocco.
&#x2022;	Sustainability: Create a platform of support, that will live on beyond the Summit, that will serve to facilitate ongoing engagement, learning, networking, and investment.

Delivery of the Summit: Execution of a well-planned summit with engagement of key stakeholders from civil society, private sector, government and general public.</narrative>
  </description>
